sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant P as Provider LLM (eksternal)

  A->>FE: Buka halaman "Kelola Provider LLM"
  FE->>API: GET /api/v1/llm/providers (cookie + X-CSRF-Token)
  API->>API: Autentikasi & cek role admin
  alt Bukan admin
    API-->>FE: 403 Forbidden
    FE-->>A: Tampilkan "akses ditolak"
  else Admin
    API->>DB: Ambil daftar provider & model
    DB-->>API: Daftar provider
    API-->>FE: 200 OK [providers]
    FE-->>A: Tampilkan daftar

    alt Tambah / ubah provider
      A->>FE: Isi nama, base URL, API key
      FE->>API: POST /llm/providers atau PATCH /llm/providers/{id}
      API->>API: Enkripsi API key
      API->>DB: Simpan provider
    else Kelola model
      A->>FE: Tambah / ubah / hapus model
      FE->>API: POST atau PATCH atau DELETE /llm/providers/{id}/models
      API->>DB: Simpan perubahan model
    else Hapus provider
      A->>FE: Konfirmasi hapus
      FE->>API: DELETE /llm/providers/{id}
      API->>DB: Hapus provider & modelnya
    else Uji koneksi (Test)
      A->>FE: Klik "Test"
      FE->>API: POST /llm/providers/{id}/test
      API->>P: Panggil provider (cek koneksi)
      P-->>API: Status koneksi
    end
    API-->>FE: Daftar provider terbaru
    FE-->>A: Tampilkan hasil
  end
